{"availability":"available","full":"surajthalange/surajthalange.github.io","name":"surajthalange.github.io","description":"Portfolio of Suraj Thalange: technical project manager and Moodle developer. Published Moodle plugins, themes and LMS delivery.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T18:03:07Z","updated":"2026-10-09T21:35:15Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://surajthalange.github.io","topics":["github-pages","moodle","no-build-step","portfolio","static-site"],"demo":"https://surajthalange.github.io/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:27.793Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:27.793Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:27.793Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:27.793Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Case studies on the Moodle plugins and themes I have published, notes on what a Moodle theme costs in page weight and what the Marketplace plugin review actually checks, and what I do for clients.","This repository holds the generated site only: HTML, CSS, one small JavaScript file and the images. It is served by GitHub Pages straight from the default branch, so every file here is a file the browser receives.","There is no framework and no client-side rendering. The pages are static HTML, the stylesheet is hand-written, and the only JavaScript is a command palette, a scroll reveal and a playable demo of one of the plugins. Nothing is fetched from a third party at run time: the fonts, the icons and the images are all served from this origin."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/surajthalange/surajthalange.github.io/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"640c71fba901fbe947c36ab645bc3685c329afd333bdcd92776d720b882a9e89","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:27.864Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:27.864Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Case studies on the Moodle plugins and themes I have published, notes on what a Moodle theme costs in page weight and what the Marketplace plugin review actually checks, and what I do for clients.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/surajthalange/surajthalange.github.io/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The screenshots themselves are captured by a script that drives Chrome over the DevTools protocol against a local Moodle, signs in as the right account, puts each page into the state the shot needs, and writes the PNG under the exact name the placeholder already references.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/surajthalange/surajthalange.github.io/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Every shot asserts something about the page before the screenshot is taken — that it is not the login form, not a permissions error, that the transcript has rows — because a capture harness that cannot tell a real page from a login screen will quietly fill a site with pictures of login screens.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/surajthalange/surajthalange.github.io/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"640c71fba901fbe947c36ab645bc3685c329afd333bdcd92776d720b882a9e89","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/surajthalange/surajthalange.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:27.864Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T21:35:15Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/surajthalange/surajthalange.github.io/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:27.865Z","hash":"640c71fba901fbe947c36ab645bc3685c329afd333bdcd92776d720b882a9e89","originalBytes":2851,"storedBytes":2851,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["page","login","plugins","shot","site","transcript","about","build","does","each","emits","moodle","public","screenshot","theme","writes","above","accessibility","account","against","already","asserts","atrium","bank.","because","before","boost","box","branded","broken","built","cannot","caption.","capture"